; The azalea tree's sphere version (2026-09-28, her "our second version that is
; a sphere instead of a egg, and smaller"): a leafy ball with a saucer of leaves
; over its top third, its brim flared out, on a bare trunk, about 2.3 m tall.
; The shape is `assets/source/props/azalea_tree_sphere.blend`; Send to game
; writes the GLB. `bloom`, `size` and `season` work as on the azalea tree.
; Visual only.

